- Shipping preset: `medium`
- All G1–G9 gates pass
- Guessing: 0/200,000
- Four attacks: 0/8 each
- Reference Gaussian solver: 8/8, 230,225 operations
- Bare oracle: easy 3/3 solved; medium 0/3 solved
- Answer: 313 characters, 144 atoms
- Compact route: 110 operations

Deliverables:

- [gen_2405_20263.py](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2405.20263/gen_2405_20263.py)
- [selftest_report.json](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2405.20263/selftest_report.json)
